Package: openjdk-21-jdk-headless
Name: OpenJDK 21 Headless Development Kit
Version: 21.0.12+ios1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Depends: openjdk-21-jre-headless (= 21.0.12+ios1)
Provides: java-compiler, java-sdk, java-sdk-headless
Description: OpenJDK 21 development tools for rootless iOS.
 Adds javac, jar, javadoc, jlink, JShell, debugger and diagnostic tools,
 headers, JMODs, manuals, and OpenJDK sources to the headless Java runtime.
Maintainer: max
Author: OpenJDK contributors and Xios
Section: Development
Priority: optional
MinimumOSVersion: 16.0
